177
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:55,320
¡Kroagunk!

178
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,200
¡Baka!

179
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,080
¡Boneri!

180
00:08:02,660 --> 00:08:03,840
